 between panes now show where to drag when you point at them.","When a commit's ancestry is highlighted in History, the other commits' text fades with their lines.","A filter above the changed files narrows the Unstaged and Staged lists by path. Staging, unstaging or discarding everything then acts only on the files you see."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.24-25","version":"0.1.0-beta.24"}],"schema_version":1,"trust":{"checksum":"sha256","manifest_signature":"Ed25519 detached signature over exact JSON bytes","signature_encoding":"base64"}}
